fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f9ead0b06cd7e49b473241cd955dc83e 3x"}, "body": "Hello! Your art style is adorable!! >w< <3\n\nCould you please draw the 2 characters in the reference?\n\nI would like if you could draw the pink bunny as a giant stomping through a city. I'd like if she can be shooting a beam out of her horn to destroy a building.\n\nI would like if the yellow bunny can be normal sized and being carried in the pink bunny's paw. If the yellow bunny can be held in the pink bunny's closed fist, that would be great ^^\n\nI would like if the pink bunny can be making a kind of evil or mischievous facial expression while she attacks the city, also!\n\nThank you very much!! Your artwork is so cute!! Thank you for considering my commission!! >w< <3\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/pOjsQJW", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@thematy_/works/13", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1566017, "client_id": 1014024, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a58afd47/uploads/origins/78f60b09-9b63-42d8-be6f-a881ad7815db?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2bd8daf4242fa65c761073a4f54b84f9", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a58afd47/uploads/origins/78f60b09-9b63-42d8-be6f-a881ad7815db?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2bd8daf4242fa65c761073a4f54b84f9, https://si.imgix.net/a58afd47/uploads/origins/78f60b09-9b63-42d8-be6f-a881ad7815db?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1ae0d58064066f2500bf3b8b072e01a5 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a58afd47/uploads/origins/78f60b09-9b63-42d8-be6f-a881ad7815db?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c486cf12828f12d7a75ffa97bff5fd14 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "cons